<mjml>
  <mj-head>
    <mj-title>TimetoPay is now free — and a lot faster</mj-title>
    <mj-preview>No more subscriptions, plus Shopping Mode and a new look.</mj-preview>
    <mj-attributes>
      <mj-all font-family="Inter, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" />
      <mj-text color="#3A4B52" font-size="16px" line-height="1.6" />
    </mj-attributes>
    <mj-style inline="inline">
      a { color: #04576A; }
    </mj-style>
  </mj-head>

  <mj-body background-color="#F7F6F9" width="600px">
    <!-- brand accent bar -->
    <mj-section background-color="#04576A" padding="0" border-radius="16px 16px 0 0">
      <mj-column><mj-spacer height="6px" /></mj-column>
    </mj-section>

    <mj-section background-color="#FFFFFF" padding="28px 32px 8px">
      <mj-column>
        <mj-image src="img/logo.png" alt="TimetoPay" width="44px" align="left" padding="0 0 16px" border-radius="10px" />
        <mj-text font-size="23px" font-weight="700" color="#17242B" line-height="1.3" padding="0 0 14px">TimetoPay is now free 🎉</mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 12px">Hi {firstName}, we've got a big one for you.</mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 12px"><strong>Everything is free now.</strong> Subscriptions and scan limits are gone. Unlimited AI receipt scanning, multi-page PDF imports, your full price history and every analytics view — all open, no card, no trial.</mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 12px">A few other things worth opening the app for:</mj-text>
        <mj-text line-height="1.85" padding="0 0 12px">🎨 <strong>A new look</strong> — redesigned throughout, with a proper dark mode that follows your phone.<br />🛒 <strong>Shopping Mode</strong> — tick items off while you're actually in the store.<br />📸 <strong>In-app camera</strong> — snap receipts directly, or share them in from Photos.<br />🧾 <strong>Tax &amp; discounts</strong> — now captured properly instead of thrown away.<br />🔍 <strong>Smarter matching</strong> — scanned items line up with what you've bought there before.</mj-text>
        <mj-text padding="0 0 12px"><span style="color:#4C6B66;">Your receipts, price history and lists are all exactly where you left them.</span></mj-text>
        <mj-button background-color="#04576A" color="#FFFFFF" href="https://5to9shopping.com/scan" border-radius="10px" font-size="16px" font-weight="600" inner-padding="14px 28px" padding="22px 0 6px" align="left">Open TimetoPay →</mj-button>
        <mj-divider border-color="#E6E4EC" border-width="1px" padding="20px 0 0" />
        <mj-text font-size="12px" color="#8FA3A0" line-height="1.6" padding="14px 0 28px">
          Thanks for sticking with us, the TimetoPay team<br />
          FivetoNine LLC · 483 Chestnut Street, Cedarhurst, NY 11518<br />
          <a href="https://5to9shopping.com" style="color:#8FA3A0;">5to9shopping.com</a> · <a href="{unsubscribe_link}" style="color:#8FA3A0;">Unsubscribe</a>
        </mj-text>
      </mj-column>
    </mj-section>
  </mj-body>
</mjml>
